{"unit_id":"gnulife__dsh-plugin-wechat#card-zh","repo":"gnulife/dsh-plugin-wechat","commit":"f92b4bf54950af711f2352e12f1e2176a00c6182","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-wechat 是把 DeepSeek Harness（DSH）接入个人微信的插件。它在 DSH 中启动原生微信通道，通过扫码登录、长轮询接收微信文字消息，并把每位发送者的消息交给对应的 DSH agent 会话，再将回复发回微信；也提供可选的 OpenAI 兼容 HTTP 桥接模式。主要能力包括按用户隔离会话、调用 DSH agent 回复、默认开放联网搜索、按配置开放项目文件工具，以及在工具处理期间发送提示。适合希望从微信与 DSH 助手对话或获取实时搜索结果的用户。需要 Node.js 22 及微信账号扫码；模型使用 DSH 当前配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/wechat.ts:150-166"]}
{"unit_id":"gnulife__dsh-plugin-wechat#card-en","repo":"gnulife/dsh-plugin-wechat","commit":"f92b4bf54950af711f2352e12f1e2176a00c6182","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-wechat connects DSH and WeChat. Scan to log in; incoming text goes to a sender-specific DSH agent session, and replies return to WeChat. It can enable web search and offers an optional OpenAI-compatible bridge. Requires Node.js 22+ and a WeChat account.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/wechat.ts:150-166"]}
